JDK vs JRE vs JVM :

Term	Stands for	What it is	Who needs it
JVM	Java Virtual Machine	The engine that loads, verifies, and executes bytecode, and manages memory and garbage collection	Anyone running Java
JRE	Java Runtime Environment	JVM plus the standard class libraries (java.lang, java.util, ...)	Historically, people who only run Java apps
JDK	Java Development Kit	JRE plus development tools: javac, jar, jdb (debugger), javadoc, jshell, ...	Developers
